### Get Documents for Promotion (Success - Promotion 51)
GET {{base_url}}/collaborations/promotion-documents/51
Accept: application/json

### Get Documents for Promotion (Success - Promotion 1)
GET {{base_url}}/collaborations/promotion-documents/1
Accept: application/json

### Get Documents for Promotion (Empty - No Documents)
GET {{base_url}}/collaborations/promotion-documents/99999
Accept: application/json 